{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会in幕張メッセ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブいかがだったでしょう。\n昨日からロマいかが頭の中で\nぐーるぐーるしてるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい曲だあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪13日の金曜日\n私のヘッドアクセは\nポンポンとチュチュなのよ。\nポンポンすきだから嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪シャキイズム\n全員でしっかりダンスしたのは\n初披露でした！\n踊ってて楽しいんだよ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪も編み込みでおそろいにした！！\n気合い入れたよね笑\n念願の伊藤ちゃんずレーンですもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予想以上に、本当にたくさんの方が\n握手しに来てくださって\nめっちゃ嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動したんだすよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめましての方も\nイトウさんも！\nちゃんず推しのみなさん\nそしてねねころ部のみなさん\nまりっ会のみなさん\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんずで\nいつか何かしたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふへへへふへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、チャリティイベント。\nご協力ありがとうございました。\nライブまで何時間も\nお待たせしてしまいました。\nでも、たくさんの方が\n会場に来てくださったおかげで\nライブ盛り上がりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちにできること。\n届いたかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブができるって幸せなことだな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも\nがんばろう！日本！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実した一日だったなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はかずみが欠席だったけど、\nみんなは気持ちは一つ。\nブログにコメントしたんだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/21/7505346/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んだかなー読んだかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}